Okay, time to revive this beast.

Where is our dialogue script?
Who is editing it?
Who is auditioning to be a voice?
Do we have a second animator? (We could use one!)

lorx was supposed to be taking care of the dialogue script, and I
haven't a clue what happened to that or where it went.
koz was supposed to be finishing whatever was bugging him about the
script.
We already have people working on the layout of the tubes.
We'll be starting storyboarding after this coming week (I hope!).
Where are the people that wanted to help? Can they contribute to the
culture document for ideas regarding holidays and social customs?

So, please update me with whatever has been done so we can continue
this lovely little stunt. =D

Thank you for your past participation and thank you especially to
those that are sticking with the project. Speak up, edit documents,
propose drastic changes, dare to agree with our ideas. Make sure you
put your name on the root document for credits!

